1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,765
Jason said, The case is behind that
wall. Lucia said, Why does your knock

2
00:00:05,765 --> 00:00:07,000
echo from above?

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:13,067
He said, Thin rock. She said, No. Thin
metal. Somebody covered the stairs

4
00:00:13,067 --> 00:00:14,000
with metal.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,250
Jason said, We pull it down. Lucia said,
And advertise ourselves to

6
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:21,000
whoever left that arrow?

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,056
He said, We're already late. She said,
Stop following the arrow and look

8
00:00:26,056 --> 00:00:28,000
where the dust hasn't settled.

9
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,500
They lifted the chain. A counterweight
raised the panel silently,

10
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:35,000
revealing stairs to the ledge above
their empty hiding place.

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,421
Jason said, They moved it upstairs.
Lucia said, They moved the sign

12
00:00:39,421 --> 00:00:42,000
downstairs. The case never left its
shelf.

13
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,250
Inside: cash, their original seal, and
blue chalk. All three had waited

14
00:00:47,250 --> 00:00:49,000
inside the same case.

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,789
Jason said, Next time, you knock. Lucia
said, Next time, you listen before

16
00:00:53,789 --> 00:00:56,000
trying to knock down the mountain.
